<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Atalanta 2 (Inzaghi 58th - penalty - and 63rd minutes)</p>
<p>Fiorentina 2 (Oliveira 16, Batistuta 83). Halftime 0-1.</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
<p>Inter 1 (Zanetti 63) Perugia 0. 0-0. 50,000</p>
<p>Juventus 2 (Boksic 9, Ferrara 58) Cagliari 1 (Villa 62). 1-0.</p>
<p>30,000</p>
<p>Lazio 0 Udinese 1 (Bia 73 - penalty). 0-0. 35,000</p>
<p>Napoli 1 (Caccia 3) Reggiana 0. 1-0. 50,000</p>
<p>Piacenza 0 Parma 0. 16,000</p>
<p>Verona 0 Bologna 2 (Kolyvanov 42, Nervo 82). 0-1. 19,000</p>
<p>Vicenza 0 Roma 2 (Fonseca 32, Balbo 65). 0-1. 19,000</p>
<p>Add first division summaries: Sampdoria 2 (Veron 45, Mancini 77) Milan 1 (Weah 13). 1-1. 32,000</p>
</text>
